OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother cold start with an
OL,6,Finland frost. Largely sunny through
OL,7,Fthe day, but more cloud developing
OL,8,Facross the Western Isles where it will
OL,9,Falso be quite windy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry through the evening with
OL,12,Fsome clear spells in the east but
OL,13,Fcloudier over the west. It will stay
OL,14,Fdry overnight with some frost in
OL,15,Fplaces again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
