OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA chilly but largely sunny
OL,6,Fmorning inland, rather cloudy over the
OL,7,FWestern Isles. Clouding over from the
OL,8,Fsoutheast through the afternoon,
OL,9,Fstaying bright in the northwest until
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FTurning unsettled on Tuesday and
OL,14,FWednesday with cloud and rain at
OL,15,Ftimes. Quite breezy around the coasts
OL,16,Fon Tuesday. Bright spells between
OL,17,Fbands of showery rain on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
